title: A folder that is not a repository: the changes panel says so, staging a change, staging a file, committing, discarding, showing a commit and the diff do nothing harmful and say something sane; no file changes
folders: plain
expect-file: plain/src/steps.rs :: ^fn step_1\(\) -> u32 \{\n    1\n\}\n[\s\S]*fn step_14\(\) -> u32 \{\n    14\n\}\n$
absent-file: plain/.git
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
wait 800
mark 1-panel
wait 500
part stage src/steps.rs 2
wait 1500
mark 2-part-stage
wait 500
git stage src/steps.rs
wait 1200
git commit nothing to commit here
wait 1500
mark 3-stage-and-commit
wait 500
git discard
wait 800
mark 4-discard-asked
wait 500
answer Discard
wait 1500
mark 5-discarded
wait 500
commit 0
wait 1200
diff on
wait 1200
changed on
wait 1200
mark 6-commit-diff-only-changed
wait 500
changed off
diff off
commit off
wait 1000
edit src/steps.rs 2 1
type // typed in a folder without git
key enter
wait 800
git discard src/steps.rs
wait 800
answer Cancel
wait 800
mark 7-typed
wait 500
key undo
key undo
wait 500
quit
wait 1000
answer Close without saving
wait 800
